# FPL Live — environment variables

# The Fantasy Premier League API is public and unauthenticated, so the app ships with
# sensible defaults and requires NO secrets to build or run.
#
# The values below are optional overrides. Copy this file to `.env` only if you need to
# point the app at a different backend (e.g. a self-hosted caching proxy).

# Optional: override the base URL of the FPL API.
# Default: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/api/
# FPL_API_BASE_URL=https://fantasy.premierleague.com/api/

# Local toolchain (source env.sh locally; not read by the app at runtime).
# JAVA_HOME=/path/to/jdk17
# ANDROID_HOME=/path/to/android-sdk
